    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<h2 data-start=\"4152\" data-end=\"4180\">Level 6 — <strong data-start=\"4165\" data-end=\"4180\">Shared Aura</strong></h2><p data-start=\"4182\" data-end=\"4211\">You extend stability outward.</p><h3 data-start=\"4213\" data-end=\"4235\">Mechanical Effects</h3><p data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4258\">While at <strong data-start=\"4245\" data-end=\"4257\">Burn 1–3</strong>:</p><ul data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4465\"><li data-start=\"4259\" data-end=\"4465\"><p data-start=\"4261\" data-end=\"4322\">Allies within 2 squares gain <strong data-start=\"4286\" data-end=\"4322\">half your Aura’s passive benefit</strong></p><ul data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4465\"><li data-start=\"4325\" data-end=\"4358\"><p data-start=\"4327\" data-end=\"4358\">Fury: +1 damage (once per turn)</p></li><li data-start=\"4361\" data-end=\"4394\"><p data-start=\"4363\" data-end=\"4394\">Resolve: +1 Guard while stationary</p></li><li data-start=\"4397\" data-end=\"4427\"><p data-start=\"4399\" data-end=\"4427\">Mercy: free nonlethal choice</p></li><li data-start=\"4430\" data-end=\"4465\"><p data-start=\"4432\" data-end=\"4465\">Dread: resistance to fear effects</p></li></ul></li></ul><p data-start=\"4467\" data-end=\"4505\">This does <strong data-start=\"4477\" data-end=\"4484\">not</strong> increase their Burn.</p><p data-start=\"4507\" data-end=\"4545\">Your certainty becomes infrastructure.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
